<h2>City of Arlington Code of Ordinances</h2>
<p>This copy of the Code of the City of Arlington, Texas, is provided solely for convenience; the Code provisions contained herein are NOT the official Code of the City of Arlington, Texas. You are urged to verify the current status and wording or content of any code provision or graphics contained herein against the official Code of the City of Arlington, Texas, before relying on any provision or graphic. At the time of distribution, this copy of the Code was current. Provisions herein may have since been amended by the City Council. The official Code of the City of Arlington, Texas, is retained in the City Secretary's Office and may be viewed during regular business hours. Current copies of the Code of the City of Arlington, Texas, may be obtained from the City of Arlington, Texas.</p>
<p>For further information regarding the official version of any of the City of Arlington Code of Ordinances, please contact the City Secretary's Office.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>
